@Gezify.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7156

### Swagger UI (Development only)

# Browser: {{Gezify.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger

### HTTPS (default `dotnet run` profile)

GET {{Gezify.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### HTTP only (`dotnet run --launch-profile http`)

GET http://localhost:8050/health
Accept: application/json

### GET /auth/me (replace TOKEN with JWT from POST /auth/google)

@token = YOUR_JWT_HERE

GET {{Gezify.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
